# Plugin runtime state and user config. Herdr normally supplies
# HERDR_PLUGIN_STATE_DIR and HERDR_PLUGIN_CONFIG_DIR, but when it does not the
# plugin falls back to writing these under the checkout. They hold the pane
# labels this plugin owns, which are real directory paths from your machine.
.local/

